  (polyline (pts (xy 248.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 220.00) (xy 408.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 258.00) (xy 248.00 220.00)) (stroke (width 0.3) (type default)) (uuid "4a749c82-f99c-54be-a267-18c0422217d3"))
  (text "(1) VC-HB-3450 is the catalogue encoder cable. The Siemens order code is TODO.\n(2) Order 6SL5510-1BB11-0AA0. This is the PTI standard drive, not the PROFINET code.\n(3) X131 is 1 STO1+, 2 STO1-, 3 STO-VS, 4 STO-M, 5 STO2+, 6 STO2-. STO-VS and STO-M are TBC.\n(4) X130 is not on this PTI drive. STO status is status word bit STO_EP. Do not land 440_S200FB yet.\n(5) X124 screws are marked 24 V and 0 V. They are not numbered. Both screws are one node.\n(6) L2 is open. Mains uses L1 and L3. DCP, R1 and R2 stay open. Fit the blanking plug.\n(7) U1 is not a DIO pin. Pulse form and scale are TBC.\n(8) Encoder map, drive to motor: 7 A, 8 B, 4 C, 5 D, 1 E, 2 F.\n(9) Power cable is 4G1.5 mm2 shielded. Brake pair is 2x0.75 mm2. The coil stays on X108.\nNets that leave this sheet are listed on the notes sheet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 249.60 221.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0fcaf4f6-ee26-586d-9b8d-add2b6d08069"))
